WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.241
In this video, we'll ship the favorite:
make it the default, record a narrated

2
00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:15.724
demo video, open a pull request,
publish a page for everyone, and merge.

3
00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:19.000
This is a real run, with the waits sped up.

4
00:00:24.699 --> 00:00:28.149
One prompt asks for all of it,
in parallel where it can.

5
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.903
It asks before it takes over the browser
tab you're using. Let it open a new page.

6
00:00:37.326 --> 00:00:40.741
It makes Big and touch friendly
the default, and records the

7
00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:44.041
demo with the demos skill while
it opens the pull request.

8
00:00:45.528 --> 00:00:48.867
It checks the video for sound
and captions, adds it and

9
00:00:48.867 --> 00:00:52.327
the page for everyone to the
pull request, and merges it.

10
00:00:52.377 --> 00:00:54.644
Then it waits for GitHub Pages to publish.

11
00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:56.659
Done.

12
00:00:56.659 --> 00:00:59.469
Big and touch friendly
is the default, the pull

13
00:00:59.469 --> 00:01:02.339
request is merged,
and it checked the live site.

14
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.678
The links are right there: the live app,

15
00:01:05.678 --> 00:01:09.213
all four toolbars side by side,
and the narrated demo.
